  view_file {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///skills/system_skills/play_policy/references/permissions_and_apis.md"
    end_line: 55
    content: "# Permissions & APIs: Google Play Compliance\n\nGoogle Play requires requesting the minimum necessary permissions and prohibits\nbroad permissions when narrower or zero-permission system APIs exist.\n\n## 1. Storage & Media: Photo Picker\n\nApps selecting photos/videos must **NOT** request broad storage permissions\n(`READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`, `WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`, `READ_MEDIA_IMAGES`,\n`READ_MEDIA_VIDEO`). Use the zero-permission **Android Photo Picker**.\n\n### Prohibited Manifest Declarations\n\n```xml\n<!-- PROHIBITED: Broad storage permissions for media picking -->\n<uses-permission android:name=\"android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\" />\n<uses-permission android:name=\"android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES\" />\n```\n\n### Compliant Implementation (Jetpack Compose)\n\n```kotlin\nval photoPickerLauncher = rememberLauncherForActivityResult(\n    contract = ActivityResultContracts.PickVisualMedia(),\n    onResult = { uri -> uri?.let { onImageSelected(it) } }\n)\n\nButton(onClick = {\n    photoPickerLauncher.launch(PickVisualMediaRequest(ActivityResultContracts.PickVisualMedia.ImageOnly))\n}) {\n    Text(\"Select Photo\")\n}\n```\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n## 2. Location Access\n\n-   Prefer `ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION` over `ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION`.\n-   **Never** request `ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION` unless core functionality\n    fails without it (e.g. continuous navigation), and always request foreground\n    location first.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n## 3. Restricted Permissions Quick Reference\n\n-   **`READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`, `READ_MEDIA_*`**: Use Android Photo Picker\n    (`PickVisualMedia`) or Storage Access Framework (`OpenDocument`).\n-   **`REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES`**: High-risk permission; open external web or\n    app store links via `Intent.ACTION_VIEW` instead of direct APK installation.\n-   **`QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES`**: Declare specific `<queries>` intent filters in\n    `AndroidManifest.xml`.\n-   **`SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW`**: Use in-app Dialogs, Snackbars, or Notification\n    Channels.\n"
    num_lines: 56
    num_bytes: 2096
    line_range_bytes: 2096
  }
}
