    content: "# Device & System Integrity: Policy Compliance\n\n## 1. Prohibition on Dynamic Code Loading (DCL)\n\nApps distributed via Google Play **MUST NOT** modify, replace, or update\nexecutable code outside Google Play:\n\n-   Never download or dynamically execute external `.dex`, `.jar`, `.apk`, or\n    `.so` files from remote storage.\n-   All code and native binaries must be bundled in the signed APK / AAB.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n## 2. Foreground Services (FGS) Declarations\n\nFor apps targeting Android 14+ (API 34+):\n\n-   Foreground services must declare a valid `android:foregroundServiceType`\n    attribute in `AndroidManifest.xml` (e.g. `dataSync`, `mediaPlayback`,\n    `location`, `camera`).\n-   Prefer `WorkManager` for deferrable background jobs.\n\n```xml\n<service\n    android:name=\".sync.DataSyncService\"\n    android:foregroundServiceType=\"dataSync\"\n    android:exported=\"false\" />\n```\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n## 3. System UI Imitation & Overlays\n\n-   Do not mimic OS notifications, dialogs, or system controls.\n-   Do not abuse `SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW` or overlay permissions for deceptive\n    clickjacking.\n"
    num_lines: 37
    num_bytes: 1222
    line_range_bytes: 1222
  }
}
